SELECT CONCAT(CDHDR.OBJECTID, '-', '00001') AS CASE_ID, 'Change Activity' AS ACTIVITY, TO_TIMESTAMP(CDHDR.UDATE, 'yyyy-MM-dd') AS EVENT_TIME, CDHDR.USERNAME AS USER_NAME, 0.0 AS AMOUNT
FROM CDHDR JOIN CDPOS ON CDHDR.CHANGENR = CDPOS.CHANGENR WHERE CDHDR.OBJECTCLAS = 'EINKBELEG' AND CDPOS.FNAME IN ('NETPR', 'MENGE', 'LIFNR') AND CDHDR.UDATE IS NOT NULL;

DROP TABLE IF EXISTS P2P_CASES;
CREATE TABLE P2P_CASES AS
SELECT DISTINCT CONCAT(EBELN, '-', EBELP) AS CASE_ID, EBELN, EBELP
FROM EKPO;

{
  "case_table": "P2P_CASES",
  "event_table": "P2P_EVENT_LOG",
  "model_type": "Case-centric",
  "tables": [
    {
      "name": "P2P_CASES",
      "type": "Case",
      "primary_keys": ["CASE_ID"],
      "description": "Master table for P2P process cases defined by Purchase Order Number and Item (EBELN-EBELP)."
    },
    {
      "name": "P2P_EVENT_LOG",
      "type": "Event",
      "primary_keys": ["CASE_ID", "ACTIVITY", "EVENT_TIME"],
      "description": "Consolidated event log containing all P2P process activities."
    },
    {
      "name": "EKKO",
      "type": "Dimension",
      "primary_keys": ["EBELN"],
      "description": "Purchase Order Header data."
    },
    {
      "name": "EKPO",
      "type": "Dimension",
      "primary_keys": ["EBELN", "EBELP"],
      "description": "Purchase Order Item details."
    },
    {
      "name": "EBAN",
      "type": "Dimension",
      "primary_keys": ["EBELN", "BNFPO"],
      "description": "Purchase Requisition data."
    },
    {
      "name": "EKBE",
      "type": "Dimension",
